      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we have two options for this, then:\n\n1. Set up a separate builder that builds the test targets but not `default` using debug/component. If we feel that running tests with debug/non-component doesn\u0027t make much sense, we can turn this existing one into compile-only and use the debug/component one to actually run tests.\n2. Fix the issue that\u0027s preventing MSVC from compiling the `default` target in component builds\n\n#2 is definitely the better long-term solution, but since I\u0027m rather unfamiliar with what\u0027s going on under the hood and I\u0027m running into different issues locally when compiling with MSVC, I don\u0027t know how likely I am to be able to get a fix ready in the near-ish future.",
